</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The bonds of death encompassed me,</l><l>Distresses of Sheol fell on me;</l><l>I fell upon trouble and sorrow.</l><l>But I called on the name of the Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O Jehovah, I pray, deliver my soul.</l><l>I was brought low, and He saved me.</l><l>My eyes from tears, my feet from stumbling.</l><l>What shall I return to Jehovah?</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
